{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And if from a male five years old.</b> Not that the one making the vow would be a minor — for the words of a minor are nothing — rather, an adult who said: the valuation of this minor, who is five years old, is upon me (see Arakhin 2a)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:53.091090078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}